WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:09,260
The three feet on the cow's head are exactly the same as those on the farm.

2
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:11,960
Yes, I agree that I got it cheap. You can’t be wrong.

3
00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:13,800
Five meters is so scary

4
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:17,600
What does the 50-meter-plus poisonous python in Taihu Lake look like?

5
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:35,060
Over there, in the shadow at the foot of the wall, there's a person

6
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:38,780
This girl is too courageous

7
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:40,940
Less than two hundred meters away from the two giant beasts

8
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:43,410
Still holding a little white tiger

9
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:45,930
Did she raise that big tiger?

10
00:00:45,930 --> 00:00:48,090
No, look at the tiger’s eyes

11
00:00:48,090 --> 00:00:51,590
Her eyes and feet were bleeding, and there was a little worry in the blood.

12
00:00:51,790 --> 00:00:54,340
She is poisoned and crazy

13
00:00:54,340 --> 00:00:55,820
He doesn't even recognize his own people

14
00:00:55,820 --> 00:00:57,480
I don’t know why

15
00:00:57,480 --> 00:00:59,280
She instinctively refused to touch the girl and the little white tiger.
